WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Okay,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.967
a number series!

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:10.567
Eighty,

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:11.133
forty,

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:11.733
twenty,

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:12.333
ten,

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:13.500
and then...

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.267
what comes next?

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:15.867
A.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:16.467
Five,

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.033
B.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:17.633
Eight,

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:18.233
C.

00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:18.800
Fifteen,

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.000
or D.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:20.567
Six?

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:21.767
Five seconds!

00:00:27.533 --> 00:00:28.733
TIME'S UP!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.933
The answer is...

00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:31.467
A,

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:31.967
five!

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:35.067
Each number is cut in half:

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:35.567
eighty,

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:36.100
forty,

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:36.600
twenty,

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:37.100
ten,

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.200
so half of ten is five.

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:41.767
So,

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:43.800
are you smart or fart?

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.233
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:47.433
find your rank!

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:48.933
So,

00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:50.333
how did you do?

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:51.700
Comment your score below,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.067
and follow for more!
